    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This multiplayer First Person Shooter recreates the sport of Airsoft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/4748ad77d576bdf1f86f96563734acaf.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features include:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>SPLIT SCREEN EVEN WITH ONLINE PLAY!! ON PC??? YES!!! IT'S NOT ILLEGAL!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Licensed Airsoft Equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Official Airsoft Field recreations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Built in Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Server Side Rollback, and Client Side Prediction for a smooth online gaming experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom Lobbies for a catered experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/00870b6cf3699d4d8365da4f54e512d7.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily play, and replay your friends online with this FPS airsoft video game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing a new field? Use our easy to use level editor to test out new layouts and designs!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking about traveling the country and want to decide what fields to play at? Visit them digitally to plan your trips!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/faf3d0f8e689d5e2752904486e6907e1.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This multiplayer First Person Shooter recreates the sport of Airsoft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/4748ad77d576bdf1f86f96563734acaf.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features include:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>SPLIT SCREEN EVEN WITH ONLINE PLAY!! ON PC??? YES!!! IT'S NOT ILLEGAL!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Licensed Airsoft Equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Official Airsoft Field recreations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Built in Level Editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Server Side Rollback, and Client Side Prediction for a smooth online gaming experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Custom Lobbies for a catered experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/00870b6cf3699d4d8365da4f54e512d7.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily play, and replay your friends online with this FPS airsoft video game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing a new field? Use our easy to use level editor to test out new layouts and designs!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thinking about traveling the country and want to decide what fields to play at? Visit them digitally to plan your trips!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478900/extras/faf3d0f8e689d5e2752904486e6907e1.avif?t=1744140882\" data-has-big /></span></p>",
